MITRE ATT&CK® data in Heimdall
==============================

internal/attack/enterprise.tsv is a trimmed copy of MITRE ATT&CK® Enterprise 20.1: the ID, name and tactics of every
technique and sub-technique for Linux or Windows, revoked and deprecated ones left out. It was written by
rust/tools/attack-table from mitre-attack/attack-stix-data, release v20.1, enterprise-attack.json
(SHA-256 539a843a7b53ed9749740b2123dddae3726b1a4831841c32aca740b011b910b5), and it is compiled into heimdalld and
heimdalld-rs. Nothing else from ATT&CK is copied. Heimdall is not made, endorsed or reviewed by MITRE.

